# .copado_exclude_autoresolve — Hsu's Ginseng Copado repository
# Files matching these patterns are NOT auto-merged by Copado when a promotion hits a conflict;
# the conflict is surfaced for manual resolution instead. Everything else (objects, fields,
# profiles, permission sets, labels, etc.) keeps Copado's XML auto-resolve.
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. '**' matches across directory levels, '*' within one level.

# Apex classes — code merges need a human
**/classes/*.cls
# Apex triggers
**/triggers/*.trigger
# Visualforce components
**/components/*.component
# Visualforce pages
**/pages/*.page
# Aura component bundles
**/aura/**
# Lightning web component bundles
**/lwc/**

# Flows — a line-level XML merge of two flow versions can produce a flow that saves but runs wrong
# (dangling connectors, duplicated elements). Hsu's change volume is mostly declarative, so flows
# are where two admins are most likely to collide.
**/flows/*.flow-meta.xml

# Layouts — left to auto-resolve (layout merges are generally safe). Uncomment to resolve by hand.
# **/layouts/*.layout-meta.xml
